      "writtenOn": "2025-08-24T20:35:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Post-merge -1, this change has a couple of hacks that broke the initialisation of Gerrit with a global-refdb.\n\n@sasa.zivkov@sap.com I did not see any comments on the hacks, but just a -2. Did you discuss them offline with @danielesassoli@gmail.com?\n\nI\u0027ve addressed the issues with I3b38acc5d60",
      "revId": "406bf5ee48a253e021b4aaa4018aba25fc0b4886",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "253b3ac4_abce6106",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1006192
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-24T20:47:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Apologies, I meant that I just saw a +2 without any discussion on the hacks or comments on the rationale behind them. With a bit of reverse engineering, I understand why they were introduced; however, they could have been totally avoided.",
      "parentUuid": "b00adf58_c612c7e8",
      "revId": "406bf5ee48a253e021b4aaa4018aba25fc0b4886",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0373f1f4_868dccef",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/pgm/init/BaseInit.java",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 280,
      "author": {
        "id": 1006192
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-24T20:35:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks like a hack, because you\u0027d like to _unbound_ the default implementation of the GitRepositoryManager to a LocalGitRepositoryManager, which cannot be instantiated immediately on the first execution of the InitLabels.",
      "revId": "406bf5ee48a253e021b4aaa4018aba25fc0b4886",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6dc2c070_70a13c8d",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/pgm/init/InitLabels.java",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 70,
      "author": {
        "id": 1006192
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-24T20:35:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This the 2nd part of the hack: to simulate an optional injection you just first bind the GitRepositoryManager with `null`, then you accept `null` (clearly isn\u0027t an acceptable value) and then you rebind it with something not null.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 70,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "406bf5ee48a253e021b4aaa4018aba25fc0b4886",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
